{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41604","headline":"九江旅夜寄山中故人 · 伍乔","name":"九江旅夜寄山中故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弱柳风高远漏沈，坐来难便息愁吟。\n江城雪尽寒犹在，客舍灯孤夜正深。\n尘土积年粘旅服，关山无处寄归心。\n此时遥羡闲眠侣，静掩云扉卧一林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}